# Commit the process, its tools and every run (runs/). Fetched company data stays out: it is large (GBs of
# exchange PDFs and cached answers), would double the project's OneDrive storage inside .git, and can be re-fetched.
data/
acknowledgements.md

# Run data set aside (abandoned runs, replaced fetches)
archive/

# Local settings, caches and scratch
# .claude/settings.json (project config) is committed; personal overrides and runtime locks are not
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
